This license makes the Software source-available. Commercial use is
permitted. Brand Guardian License 1.0 Standard is the default tier.
Unlike tighter Brand Guardian License tiers (No Competing Use, and No
Competing Use, No Incorporation), Standard does NOT reserve Competing
Use or ban Incorporation. Branding remains reserved.

The full license below governs your rights and obligations.

================================================================================
1. DEFINITIONS
================================================================================

"Software" means source code, documentation, configuration, and other
materials in the distribution that adopts this license, except Branding.

"Branding" means the project names, logos, icons, splash screens, visual
identity, and trade dress designated in the COPYRIGHT NOTICE or LICENSE
header of the Software distribution (and any confusingly similar marks).
Branding is NOT licensed under this document. Use of Branding requires
separate written permission from the copyright holder.

"Prohibited Distribution" means any distribution of the Software (or a
derivative) that:

 (a) is a frivolous or duplicate listing in an app store, marketplace, or
     similar channel that adds no substantial value;

 (b) is malicious (for example contains malware, steals data, or harms
     users); or

 (c) is cognitively or commercially abusive, including stuffing the
     product with ads, dark patterns, or monetization that exploits
     users or the reputation of the project without adding
     commensurate value.

"Incorporation" means distributing, bundling, embedding, or otherwise
including the Software (or a derivative) as part of your own product.
Under Brand Guardian License 1.0 Standard, Incorporation is permitted,
provided you comply with Branding rules and do not engage in Prohibited
Distribution.

